    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "Interestingly, one of the most powerful lessons I've learned from my YPO membership, which is now about 10 years, is the power of family businesses. I've observed generations building on the successes of prior generations, and it doesn't happen naturally. You've got to be very strategic and thoughtful about how do you prepare a business for generations, and how do you encourage their enthusiastic embracement of the business rather than encumber them with the responsibilities. Right. So most family businesses actually don't survive through the third",
