      },
      {
        "text": "Our core mission centers on helping clients live a good life.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Human concerns include business, family, finances, legacy, spirituality, physical health, and relationship health.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Individuals define success differently based on personal values.",
